      <p data-template-id="learn-copy" class="canva-text muted mb-5" style="color: rgb(105, 86, 99); font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-size: 16px;">Seven approachable starting points for healthcare study.</p><label data-template-id="search-label" class="canva-text block mb-2" for="topic-search" style="color: rgb(56, 37, 52); font-weight: 700; font-style: normal; font-size: 16px;">Search topics</label><input id="topic-search" data-template-id="search-input" class="canva-input mb-5" type="search" placeholder="Search modules, terms, or objectives" style="font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-size: 16px;">
      <p id="search-empty" data-template-id="search-empty-text" class="canva-text panel p-6 hidden-force" style="font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-size: 16px;">No modules match your search. Try another term.</p>
