        <p data-template-id="topic-vitals-desc" class="canva-text small-copy" style="color: rgb(97, 78, 92); font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-size: 16px;">Vital signs are observations that help describe basic body functions over time.</p>
        <p data-template-id="topic-vitals-objective" class="canva-text small-copy" style="color: rgb(97, 78, 92); font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-size: 16px;">Objective: name four commonly observed vital signs.</p>
        <p data-template-id="topic-vitals-terms" class="canva-text small-copy" style="color: rgb(97, 78, 92); font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-size: 16px;">Key terms: pulse, respiration, temperature.</p>
        <p data-template-id="topic-vitals-safety" class="canva-text small-copy" style="color: rgb(97, 78, 92); font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-size: 16px;">Safety note: interpretation belongs to qualified professionals in clinical context.</p><button type="button" class="complete-btn secondary mt-auto" data-module="vitals" aria-label="Mark Vital signs complete"><span>Mark complete</span></button>
       </article>
       <article class="topic-card panel" data-module="ethics" data-search="ethics confidentiality consent autonomy privacy">
        <span class="pill self-start">06 · PRINCIPLES</span>
        <h2 data-template-id="topic-ethics-title" class="canva-text" style="color: rgb(56, 37, 52); font-weight: 700; font-style: normal; font-size: 24px;">Ethics</h2>
        <p data-template-id="topic-ethics-desc" class="canva-text small-copy" style="color: rgb(97, 78, 92); font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-size: 16px;">Healthcare ethics considers respect, fairness, privacy, and informed decision-making.</p>
        <p data-template-id="topic-ethics-objective" class="canva-text small-copy" style="color: rgb(97, 78, 92); font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-size: 16px;">Objective: describe why confidentiality matters.</p>
        <p data-template-id="topic-ethics-terms" class="canva-text small-copy" style="color: rgb(97, 78, 92); font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-size: 16px;">Key terms: autonomy, consent, confidentiality.</p>
        <p data-template-id="topic-ethics-safety" class="canva-text small-copy" style="color: rgb(97, 78, 92); font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-size: 16px;">Safety note: follow applicable laws, policies, and professional guidance.</p><button type="button" class="complete-btn secondary mt-auto" data-module="ethics" aria-label="Mark Ethics complete"><span>Mark complete</span></button>
       </article>
       <article class="topic-card panel" data-module="communication" data-search="patient communication active listening teach-back empathy">
        <span class="pill self-start">07 · CONNECTION</span>
        <h2 data-template-id="topic-communication-title" class="canva-text" style="color: rgb(56, 37, 52); font-weight: 700; font-style: normal; font-size: 24px;">Patient communication</h2>
        <p data-template-id="topic-communication-desc" class="canva-text small-copy" style="color: rgb(97, 78, 92); font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-size: 16px;">Clear, respectful communication supports understanding and trust.</p>
        <p data-template-id="topic-communication-objective" class="canva-text small-copy" style="color: rgb(97, 78, 92); font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-size: 16px;">Objective: explain active listening and teach-back.</p>
        <p data-template-id="topic-communication-terms" class="canva-text small-copy" style="color: rgb(97, 78, 92); font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-size: 16px;">Key terms: empathy, teach-back, listening.</p>
        <p data-template-id="topic-communication-safety" class="canva-text small-copy" style="color: rgb(97, 78, 92); font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-size: 16px;">Safety note: use an appropriate interpreter when required; avoid assumptions.</p><button type="button" class="complete-btn secondary mt-auto" data-module="communication" aria-label="Mark Patient communication complete"><span>Mark complete</span></button>
       </article>
